==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Belial (Enemy)|Belial]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Belial is quite weak in this stage, but has long range, so any units that can tank his hits will work.

